## Build output
bin/
obj/
publish/
artifacts/
*.user

## This repo standardizes on the .slnx (XML solution) format; lint.yml also hard-fails CI if a
## .sln is tracked, but ignoring it too stops IDEs from generating one that a `git add .` scoops up.
*.sln

## Test and coverage output
TestResults/
StrykerOutput/
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json

## Local caches and models (never committed — vendor installers stay under their own licenses)
models/
source/
cache/
*.tmp
*.partial
